  "test_boundary_findings": [
    "The three external cfg(test) modules implement the current public GraphicsDevice buffer trait locally. The core-owned InstancedWall unit tests retain the same valid crate-local test device. No production cfg visibility, Cargo feature or dependency is altered.",
